    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d449">

                <pb facs="0590" n="548" xml:id="pg548"/>

                <head>Mr. Seward to Lord Lyons.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <hi
                                rendition="#italic">Washington</hi>,</placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1863-04-06"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >April</hi> 6, 1863.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">My Lord</hi>: With reference to your communication of
                    the 2d instant, recommending to consideration the request of the passengers of
                    the captured British steamer Peterhoff to be allowed to leave the vessel with
                    their personal effects, in order to have free access to her Majesty’s consul at
                    New York, and to my reply, I now have the honor to enclose to you the copy of a
                    letter of the 4th of this month from the Secretary of the Navy on the
                    subject.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be, with high consideration, your lordship’s obedient
                    servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILLIAM H. SEWARD.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Right Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lord Lyons.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
